<h1 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 16.1px 0.0px; font: 24.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #138756; -webkit-text-stroke: #138756"><span class="s1"><b>How Much Does a Kitchen Remodel Cost in 2026? Complete Price Guide</b></span></h1>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"><i>Meta Title: Kitchen Remodel Cost 2026: $15K-$75K Breakdown by Project Type</i> <i>Meta Description: Kitchen remodel costs in 2026 range from $15,000 to $75,000+. See exact price breakdowns by project size, materials, and region.</i></span></p>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">Thinking about remodeling your kitchen? Here's what you'll actually pay in 2026—broken down by project type, materials, and location.</span></p>
