<p class="p2"><span class="s1"><b>Key insight:</b> Modest, well-executed remodels recoup more than over-the-top renovations.</span></p>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #0f6745; -webkit-text-stroke: #0f6745"><span class="s1"><b>Sample Kitchen Remodel Quotes</b></span></h2>
