  <li class="li6"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">Hardware: $500</span></li>
  <li class="li6"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">Labor: $3,000</span></li>
</ul>
<h3 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.0px 0.0px; font: 14.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #0d4e36; -webkit-text-stroke: #0d4e36"><span class="s1"><b>Example 2: Mid-Range Renovation ($42,000)</b></span></h3>
