  <li class="li6"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">Electrical updates: $2,500</span></li>
  <li class="li6"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">Plumbing updates: $1,800</span></li>
  <li class="li6"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">Backsplash (tile): $2,200</span></li>
